<script language="javascript" src="../../_dwr/interface/NewsvoteDWR.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="../../_dwr/engine.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/news/newscontent.js"></script><LINK href="/system/resource/js/photoswipe/3.0.5.1/photoswipe.css" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet"><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/photoswipe/3.0.5.1/pw.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/ajax.js"></script><form name="_newscontent_fromname">
    <h2>关于缴纳2025年度大学生医保费的补充通知</h2>
			<h3><span>作者：</span><span>时间：2024-09-27</span><span>点击数：<script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1827564999, 2466)</script></span></h3>
<div class="con_con"><p>
    <div id="vsb_content"><div class="v_news_content">
<style>.docx-wrapper { background: gray; padding: 30px; padding-bottom: 0px; display: flex; flex-flow: column; align-items: center;} .docx-wrapper>section.docx { background: white; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); margin-bottom: 30px;}.docx { color: black; hyphens: auto;}section.docx { box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-flow: column nowrap; position: relative; overflow: hidden;}section.docx>article { margin-bottom: auto; z-index: 1;}section.docx>footer { z-index: 1;}.docx table { border-collapse: collapse;}.docx table td, .docx table th { vertical-align: top;}.docx p { margin: 0pt !important; min-height: 1em;}.docx span { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word;}.docx a { color: inherit; text-decoration: inherit;}</style><style>.docx {  --docx-majorhansi-font: 等线 Light;  --docx-minorhansi-font: 等线;  --docx-dk1-color: #000000;  --docx-lt1-color: #FFFFFF;  --docx-dk2-color: #44546A;  --docx-lt2-color: #E7E6E6;  --docx-accent1-color: #5B9BD5;  --docx-accent2-color: #ED7D31;  --docx-accent3-color: #A5A5A5;  --docx-accent4-color: #FFC000;  --docx-accent5-color: #4472C4;  --docx-accent6-color: #70AD47;  --docx-hlink-color: #0563C1;  --docx-folhlink-color: #954F72;}</style><style>.docx span {  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);}.docx p, p.docx_1 {  text-align: justify;}.docx p, p.docx_1 span {  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}.docx table, table.docx_2 td {  padding-top: 0.00pt;  padding-left: 5.40pt;  padding-bottom: 0.00pt;  padding-right: 5.40pt;}span.docx_4 {  color: #0563C1;  text-decoration: underline;}</style><style>p.docx-num-1-0:before {  content: ""counter(docx-num-1-0, simp-chinese-informal)"、";  counter-increment: docx-num-1-0;}p.docx-num-1-0 {  display: list-item;  list-style-position: inside;  list-style-type: none;}:root {  counter-reset: docx-num-1-0 0;}</style><p style="text-indent: 0em; font-size: 29px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font); text-align: justify; text-indent: 88.1pt; font-weight: bold; min-height: 22pt; font-size: 22pt;">关于缴纳</span><span style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 88.1pt; font-family: 华文中宋; font-weight: bold; min-height: 22pt; font-size: 22pt;">2025</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font); text-align: justify; text-indent: 88.1pt; font-weight: bold; min-height: 22pt; font-size: 22pt;">年度大学生</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font); text-align: justify; text-indent: 88.1pt; font-weight: bold; min-height: 22pt; font-size: 22pt;">基本医疗保险费的补充通知</span><br></p><section class="docx"><article><p style="line-height: 1.5; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="min-height: 14pt; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;">各学院及学生：</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 28pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 21px;">根据《西安市医疗保障局等八部门转发关于做好 2024 年城乡居民基本医疗保险参保缴费工作的通知》市医保发〔2024〕51号文件和西安市医疗保障局等四部门《关于确定2024年城乡居民医保资助参保标准的通知》市医保发〔2024〕55号文件规定，现将我校2025年度大学生医保缴纳具体事项通知如下：</span></p><p class="docx-num-1-0" style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 32pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;">缴费标准</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 21px;">普通学生参保个人缴费标准每人每年400元；</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 28.1pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt;">陕西省内</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; min-height: 14pt;">特困供养人员（含孤儿）给予全额资助，个人参保不用缴纳费用；</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 28.1pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt;">陕西省内</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; min-height: 14pt;">低保对象、脱贫不稳定、边缘易致贫户、返贫致贫户、突发严重困难户给予部分资助，个人参保缴纳标准每人每年110元。</span></span></p><p class="docx-num-1-0" style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 32pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 21px;">待遇享受期</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 28pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt;">2024级新生及未缴纳上年度大学生医保的学生：待遇享受期为</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; min-height: 14pt;">2024年9月1日至2025年12月31日；</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 28pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 21px;">连续参保的学生待遇享受期为2025年1月1日至2025年12月31日。</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 28.1pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 21px;">三、缴费时间和缴费方式</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 28pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; color: black; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 21px;">缴费时间：即日起至2024年11月10日。</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 28pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; color: black; min-height: 14pt;">缴费方式：采取网上自助缴费，</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; color: black; min-height: 14pt;">登录</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; min-height: 14pt;">校医院医保及体检管理系统，网址：https://ybtjxt.xidian.edu.cn。</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 28pt; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center;"><span style="position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 390pt; height: 201.1pt; min-height: 14pt; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;"><img src="/__local/2/07/49/79F10B0D2897FEFCE58EDFD315A_8051C83C_3EF02.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/2074979F10B0D2897FEFCE58EDFD315A/8051C83C/3EF02" vheight=" 201.1pt" vwidth=" 390pt" orisrc="/__local/A/05/CF/D03F25B1D0B0A220C4F7986701E_DA2D884B_D2DF4.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 390pt; height: 201.1pt;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 32pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 21px;">四、注意事项</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 28pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; min-height: 14pt;">1.</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; color: black; min-height: 14pt;">大学生原则上在学籍地参保，不得重复参保。选择在校参保缴费的学生，在家无需重复缴纳当地医保。大学生医保只能通过学校统一缴纳，不可自行手机或银行缴纳。</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 28pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; color: black; min-height: 14pt;">2.</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt; background-color: yellow;">陕西省外的2024级新生</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt;">如在校参保，必须在2024年10月20日前将家里的居民医保或职工医保</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt; background-color: yellow;">办理停保</span><span lang="null" style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: bold; color: black; min-height: 14pt;">。</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; color: black; min-height: 14pt;">停保流程：下载“国家医保服务平台”APP</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; min-height: 14pt;">—</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; color: black; min-height: 14pt;">左下角“地方专区”</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; min-height: 14pt;">—</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; color: black; min-height: 14pt;">点击本省地区</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; min-height: 14pt;">—</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; color: black; min-height: 14pt;">业务办理</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; min-height: 14pt;">—</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; color: black; min-height: 14pt;">城乡居民暂停参保。陕西省内的新生系统会自动停保，不用个人办理。</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; min-height: 14pt;">3.</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt;">陕西省内特殊贫困人员</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt;">先在缴费系统申请并上传材料，待税务部门审核通过后再缴费。</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 28pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; min-height: 14pt;">4.放弃参保的学生，需在校医院缴费系统申请弃保。在系统中未缴费也未申请弃保的，一律视为自动弃保。弃保后不能享受医保待遇。</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 28pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; min-height: 14pt;">5.</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt;">使用缴费系统时，有关技术问题可进技术人员QQ群（</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; min-height: 14pt;">231623124</span><span lang="null" style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt;">）私信咨询，或点击页面右上角的</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt;">“操作手册”</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt;">查看。</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; min-height: 14pt;">了解医保政策请关注“西安电子科技大学医院”微信公众号—师生医保—大学生医保。</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 28pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><br></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 28pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt;">大学生医保事关每个学生的切身利益，为了无遗漏、高效率地完成学生参保费用的征缴工作，请各学院（书院）相关部门高度重视。</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; min-height: 14pt;">务必及时通知到每位学生，督促其在规定时间内完成网上自助缴费，尤其是休学或实习的学生。逾期未缴费的均视</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt;">作自动弃保，相关责任自负。</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 21px;">医保办咨询服务电话： 029-88201871 (北校区医院三楼）</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-weight: normal; min-height: 14pt; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 029-81892663 (南校区医院一楼）</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 21px;">电话咨询时间: 周内正常工作日</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: right;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: normal; min-height: 14pt;">西安电子科技大</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; min-height: 14pt;">学医院</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px; text-indent: 28pt;">大学生医保办公室</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: right;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; min-height: 14pt;">2024年9月26日</span></span></p></article></section><p><br></p>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div></p>
</div>
    




